      'To install Phalcon in WebFaction, follow the instructions outlined <a href="https://community.webfaction.com/questions/13689/phalcon-php">here</a>',
    ],
  },
  {
    name: 'Windows Azure',
    href: 'https://www.windowsazure.com',
    logo: '/images/hosting/azure-gray.jpg',
    paragraphs: [
